<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.0"><meiHead xml:lang="en"><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Pa 1235-238-6</title></titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier>https://corpus-monodicum.de/d/87aa481e-7e0e-435b-8c17-a090766b5386</identifier><respStmt><corpName role="publisher">Corpus Monodicum</corpName></respStmt><address><addrLine>Domerschulstraße 13</addrLine><addrLine>97070 Würzburg</addrLine></address><availability><useRestrict auth.uri="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/">CC BY-NC 4.0</useRestrict></availability><date isodate="2026-11-04"/></pubStmt><seriesStmt><title>Corpus Monodicum</title><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>Elaine Stratton Hild</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Gunilla Iversen</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Ritva Maria Jacobsson</persName></respStmt><funder>Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz</funder></seriesStmt><notesStmt><annot startid="#m-75158371-d5a5-4213-9f2a-255925f82026" endid="#m-44c7c1d1-21c3-4d67-94a0-bbe0c904ce0a"><table><tr><td><rend>[[Gloria ... sancto]]</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Leerstellen am Ende der Doxologie nach dem Wort [[sancto]]. In ((Pa 9449)), f. 70v, findet sich an dieser Stelle ein langes Melisma (melodischer Tropus).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-c52420c1-f8f3-446d-a18c-a30b939d02c7" endid="#m-8089621a-49a4-43ee-a3e8-38e5f0f90666"><table><tr><td><rend>[[Exultate ... collaudacio]]</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Leerstellen am Ende des Psalmverses nach dem Wort [[collaudacio]]. In ((Pa 9449)), f. 70v, findet sich an dieser Stelle ein langes Melisma (melodischer Tropus).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>Das Graduale der Handschrift enthält zum gleichen Fest das Incipit [[Gavdeamvs omnes]] mit dem Psalmvers [[Gaudent angeli et exultant archangeli et conlaudant in celis filium dei]] (f. 107v).</rend></td></tr><tr><td><rend>Der Text der Einsatzmarken D und F unterscheidet sich von dem des Primärgesangs (im Graduale zum Fest ((AGATHE MARTIRIS)), f. 36, ((Pa 1235-36-6))) in der Verwendung des Pluralpronomens und des Psalmverses [[Exultate]].</rend></td></tr><tr><td><rend>((71, 37, 38, 39, 73, 74, 61:)) Hexameter (((37)) mit metrischen Fehlern).</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-1235"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1235</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 1235-238-6</identifier><title>Hodie mundo festivus ... omnium sanctorum</title><incip><incipText><p>Hodie mundo festivus ... omnium sanctorum</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="238">f. 238, l. 6</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>Gaudeamus intr 33 34 A 35 C 70 E F A 71 D 72 G 18 A H 37 A 38 D 39 E 73 A 74 D 61 E (CT X)</bibl><bibl type="printed-edition">II-1</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Tropus</term><term type="genre">Introitus-Tropus</term><term type="feast">Omnes sancti</term><term type="feast">Messe</term><term type="Editor">Elaine Stratton Hild</term><term type="Bezugsgesang">Pa 1235-36-6-</term><term type="Endseite">238v</term><term type="Endzeile">7</term><term type="FestUndGattung">Gaudeamus intr</term><term type="Band_Genre">Tropus</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1235</identifier><identifier type="cantus">Pa 1235</identifier><titleStmt><title>Pa 1235</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">Nevers</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen französischer Herkunft</geogName><corpName role="origin-institution">Kathedrale Saint-Cyr</corpName><date>12. Jh (um 1150)</date></creation><langUsage><language xml:lang="la"/></langUsage><classification><termList><term type="quellentyp">Graduale mit Tropus, Prozessionar, Tonar, Hymnar, Tropar-Sequentiar</term></termList></classification><itemList><item><identifier type="shelfmark">Nouv. acq. lat. 1235</identifier><physLoc><repository><geogName role="settlement">Paris</geogName><corpName>Bibliothèque nationale de France</corpName></repository></physLoc></item></itemList><relationList><relation rel="hasReproduction" target="https://gallica.bnf.fr/iiif/ark:/12148/btv1b8432301z/manifest.json" label="IIIF manifest"/></relationList></manifestation></manifestationList><revisionDesc><change isodate="2026-11-04"><changeDesc><p>Exported with Monodi-Zero 0.9.1.</p></changeDesc></change></revisionDesc></meiHead><music><body><mdiv type="main"><score><scoreDef><staffGrp><staffDef n="1" notationtype="neume" lines="5" clef.shape="G" clef.line="2"/></staffGrp></scoreDef><section xml:id="m-d7e4f2a2-3805-4cda-a0f2-a1f0ad29abaa"><section xml:id="m-ceaec7d1-c1b3-4cb2-93f6-d42d68ea1b07"/><section xml:id="m-32bea31c-1439-4872-81c9-9741f8fa09d6" label="33" type="Tropenelement"><sb xml:id="m-8d08e9dd-3c77-4337-9a30-30290e260f28"/><staff n="1"><layer n="1"><annot xml:id="m-6bf54277-bc4d-4f8b-9edc-c765e5f3abb2" type="paratext" label="Festtag">IN FESTIUITATE OMNIUM SANCTORUM (f. 238)</annot><syllable xml:id="m-c9b72919-6afc-40f8-a1a8-42cad90d5cbf"><syl wordpos="i" con="d">Ho-</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-4e8058e3-5813-4032-9526-89f62267ecdc" pname="c" oct="4"/></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-e488ffa3-0812-4010-bc6a-3254e84eacfe"><syl wordpos="m" con="d">di-</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-e1511425-1bcb-474e-a09d-1ddeee6696c4" pname="c" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-d4dbdfd0-7948-41cc-a52b-984204fdc348" pname="d" oct="4"/></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-801aed57-959d-420f-99b9-2b3c5ea938f9"><syl wordpos="t">e</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-da4676c5-7077-4158-a551-c084cad1c62b" pname="d" oct="4"/></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-0c1e5608-a680-442f-a93b-9d3d23f061a0"><